Viewcreen control dan intercoms dan sebagainya.

972
01:04:51.508 --> 01:04:52.975
Di sini kita memiliki...

973
01:04:53.010 --> 01:04:55.570
Di sini, backup conn dan ops panel

974
01:04:55.612 --> 01:04:57.842
